{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And all the men who were Korah's.</b> What is 'all the men'? If the sons of Korah — it is already written that the sons of Korah did not die, and the Korahite clan is recorded in many places. And if the 250 men — they were burned. Rather, these are the women and the children and his slaves and his maidservants."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:18:17.862873343Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}